# Allowlist for scripts/ci/no-private-refs.sh — a security decision, not a convenience.
#
# One rule per line, `path/glob:pattern  # justification`. The glob matches the repo-relative
# path; the pattern is an ERE matched against the whole `git grep` hit (`path:line:text`).
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored. A justification is mandatory in review.
#
# ⛔ Do NOT add an entry to keep a real internal hostname, address or private repository path
# in a public tree. Remove it instead. An entry is only for a string that *looks* private but
# is not: a documented loopback example, a placeholder, or a term that collides with a rule.
#
# The guard and this file necessarily spell the patterns out; the guard excludes both from
# its own scan. Everything else is scanned.
#
# No entries by default. An empty file that fails the build is the correct starting state.

# --- strata_rag, reviewed 2026-11-13 ---------------------------------------------------------
# The SSRF guard's denylist: these suffixes ARE the control. No host is named.
src/providers/ssrf.rs:.*BLOCKED_SUFFIXES.*
src/providers/ssrf.rs:.*unique-local, unspecified.*
src/metering.rs:.*"(\.internal|\.ts\.net)",$
# Refusal/classification fixtures: synthetic names and CGNAT literals the guard must reject.
src/providers/ssrf.rs:.*(100\.64\.0\.[12]|100\.127\.255\.255|100\.100\.1\.1:443).*
src/providers/ssrf.rs:.*(foo\.internal\.|example\.internal|example\.svc\.cluster\.local).*
tests/tenant_providers.rs:.*(100\.64\.0\.[12]|foo\.internal\.|example\.internal|example\.svc\.cluster\.local|llm-provider\.internal).*
src/metering.rs:.*(provider\.example\.internal|100\.64\.0\.9|tei\.example\.svc\.cluster\.local).*
# Documentation of that denylist: generic DNS suffixes, no host.
README.md:.*single-label name or end in .*
src/providers/deployment.rs:.*internal hosts \(loopback, private, CGNAT.*
# Picks the self-signed-CA default for a private host: names the suffix, not a host.
eval/hotpotqa/config.py:.*endswith\("\.internal"\).*
# Recorded 2026-09-17 provenance of the promoted KAG baseline; kept verbatim, not rewritten.
eval/hotpotqa/data/kag_n50_20260902.summary.json:.*"judge".*
